# A closure over a SCOPED collection, and a parameter-scoped collection.
rule fixture.reaches v0.1
says "The goal node is reachable from the holder's start node over edges the holder has opened."
subject holder
parameter goal : node
collection starts : start-node for subject via holder
collection goals  : goal-mark  for goal via node
collection edges  : open-edge  for subject via holder
closure reach over edges from origin to target
conclude Reaches when
  some start-node a in starts
  some goal-mark g in goals
  require a.node reach g.node
